"When the network disconnects and reconnects Tuba will detect it and "
"gracefully recover"
msgstr ""
"Saat jaringan terputus dan tersambung kembali, Tuba akan mendeteksinya dan "
"memulihkan dengan baik"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:229
msgid "Proxy URL"
msgstr "URL Proksi"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:231
msgid ""
"Leaving it empty will use the default connection which might be proxied "
"based on the system settings"
msgstr ""
"Membiarkannya kosong akan menggunakan koneksi default yang mungkin "
"diproksikan berdasarkan pengaturan sistem"

#. translators: setting that when enabled sends the user's settings to tuba's servers (anonymously)
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:235 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:247
msgid "Send Preference Analytics"
msgstr "Kirim Analitik Preferensi"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:237
msgid ""
"Send your preferences to Tuba's developers for popularity research biweekly. "
"You can preview exactly what's being sent in-app, they are opt-in and the "
"server is open source."
msgstr ""
"Kirim preferensi Anda ke pengembang Tuba untuk penelitian popularitas setiap "
"dua minggu. Anda dapat melihat pratinjau tepat apa yang dikirim di dalam "
"aplikasi, bersifat opsional dan servernya bersumber terbuka."

#. translators: setting title that when enabled gathers tuba's donators every 2nd week; supporters = tuba contributors and sponsors
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:241 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:273
